  /// request is well formed, but the action isn't supported for your account,
  /// Region, or resource. OTHER – The request isn't valid for another
  /// reason.
  pub reason: ValidationExceptionReason? = None
  /// The request members that failed validation. This member is populated
  /// when reason is FIELD_VALIDATION_FAILED .
